  "details": "Lots of adult communities who try to go with VRChat ToS get swept into a ban and given hardly any reason why. I've spoken to many group leaders, and many of them would be more than happy to comply with the rules no matter what (warnings in group bio, 18+ only members, Group only instances) yet they still get wiped. Even groups who are just meant for casual adult hangouts get banned. It is a growing issue of lack of communication between Mods of VRC and their users. \n\nInstead of outright banning those groups, making group tags like #adult or #18+ would keep those groups invisible to non-verified users. Even when repped as a banner, the group would not show and remain blank. Public 18+ instances from adult groups, or even normal groups remain hidden from general users.",
